        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಪರಿಸ್ಥಿತಿ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪರಿಸ್ಥಿತಿ — paristhiti — \"a state of affairs; a situation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪ್ರವಾಹದ ನಂತರ ಊರಿನ ಪರಿಸ್ಥಿತಿ ಕೆಟ್ಟದಾಗಿತ್ತು. pravāhada nantara ūrina paristhiti keṭṭadāgittu. After the flood the situation in town was bad."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪರಿ- (around) + ಸ್ಥಿತಿ (state)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪರಿಸ್ಥಿತಿ (paristhiti) is built from Sanskrit pari-, \"around\", and sthiti, \"standing, state\" (Monier-Williams): the state of things around."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
